---
description: Neighborhood pages must use FenceStylesPreview photo cards, not custom text-only style grids
alwaysApply: true
---

# Fence style cards on neighborhood pages

For the Popular Fence Styles section, render `<FenceStylesPreview city="{Neighborhood}" />` from `@/components/FenceStylesPreview`.

That is the same photo + badge card grid city service-area pages use. Do not replace it with a 3-column text-only Card grid (Picture Frame / Hogwire / Hybrid copy cards).
